## Model card (verified spec facts only)

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 Preview
- **Short description:** Multimodal reasoning LLM from Meituan for coding and agentic workflows, with a 1M-token context window and text + image inputs.
- **Provider / access:** Vercel AI Gateway `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (per CloudPrice, 2026-10-01); Blackbox Router `blackboxai/meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` via `https://enterprise.blackbox.ai/v1/chat/completions` (OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions). No OpenCode Zen Free ID known.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-26 (Blackbox model page + CloudPrice, corroborating). Knowledge cutoff: no verified public data found.
- **IDs:** `meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`, `meituan-longcat-2-5-preview`, `blackboxai/meituan/longcat-2.5-preview` (no Zen Free ID exists)
- **Context window:** 1.0M total — 1,048,576 tokens, max output 131,072 (verified via Blackbox model page and CloudPrice API, both retrieved 2026-10-01)
- **Modalities:** Text + image in, text out; reasoning supported (default effort); function calling yes; parallel function calling no; prompt caching yes. Structured outputs: conflicting evidence (Blackbox tags list `structured-output`, CloudPrice API reports `native_structured_output: false`) — no verified data.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** Paid — $0.30 / 1M input, $1.20 / 1M output, $0.006 / 1M cache read (Vercel AI Gateway via CloudPrice; corroborated by Blackbox model page). No free tier found.
- **Architecture:** Closed-weight (Blackbox: dedicated deployment not available, listed as closed-weight model); parameter count: no verified public data found.

